            "sections": [
              {
                "heading": "What happened",
                "bullets": [
                  "The 24-hour PSI reached 112 overnight, in the unhealthy range.",
                  "Hotspots in Sumatra rose after two dry weeks; winds carry the smoke east."
                ]
              },
              {
                "heading": "What to do",
                "bullets": [
                  "Cut long outdoor exercise until the PSI is under 100.",
                  "An N95 mask helps if you are outdoors for hours."
